1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,338
So the three characteristics you can hear each match one physical quantity.

2
00:00:05,338 --> 00:00:07,669
Loudness goes with intensity.

3
00:00:07,669 --> 00:00:09,505
Pitch goes with frequency.

4
00:00:09,505 --> 00:00:15,208
And quality goes with the waveform, that is, with the overtones present.

